 playing it over and over again.\nPlus full body IK system, dressing up store and various social interactions and social game modes. Hibow will not only give you joy and unforgettable experience, but also friendships.\n\nCome and find more!", "short_description": "A multiplayer Battle Royale archery fighting game with unique flying experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://chesstar.com/?privacy_10%2F", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Chesstar Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sidequestvr.com/app/967", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "FLYING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "ko", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "984543988823017"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "380339186548252"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "380339186548252"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1620752400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "380339186548252"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9032774616804125", "version": "0.9.7.1"}, "id": "3757261984365078", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Applica